Remove 24 counter names that could never match a file in sysfs, along with their `metadata.csv` rows. Nine were standard counters carrying a `port_` prefix or a `_64` suffix that the kernel does not use, fourteen were Ethernet driver statistic names that are not part of the RDMA counter interface, and one was the RDMA core's writable cache-lifetime setting rather than a counter. None of them ever emitted data. Dashboard widgets that queried them have been repointed to the equivalent real counters or removed.
